{"sourceUrl":"https://qlyxjxgl.sdu.edu.cn/info/2003/16538.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:07.766530+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://qlyxjxgl.sdu.edu.cn/info/2003/16538.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>亲爱的</span><span>STAR营员们：</span></span><span><br/></span><span>欢迎</span><span>你</span><span>参加山东大学附属生殖医院第</span><span>九</span><span><span>届</span><span>STAR全国优秀大学生线上夏令营！现将活动日程及相关事宜通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span>22</span><span><span>日</span><span>-7月</span></span><span>23</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><strong><span>活动形式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>线上平台（腾讯会议，具体入会链接另行通知）</span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、日程安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>Day 1：开营仪式与学科介绍</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>08:00-08:30 开营致辞  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>08:30-09:30 研究院及学科发展概况  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>10:30-12:00 研究方向与导师团队介绍  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>14:00-15:00 实验室云参观</span></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>15:00-17:00 在读研究生交流  </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Day 2：营员展示、互动与闭营</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>08:30-11:30 营员个人展示（形式不限，2-3分钟/人）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>13:30-17:00 分组讨论/导师组线上座谈  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>• </span></span><span>17:00-17:30 闭营仪式</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、注意事项</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1、</span><span>QQ</span><span>群通知：请所有营员务必扫描下方二维码加入本次夏令营官方</span><span>QQ</span><span><span>群（群名：</span><span>2026山大生殖优秀大学生夏令营），后续会议链接、要求等将通过</span></span><span>QQ</span><span>群发布。</span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://qlyxjxgl.sdu.edu.cn/__local/2/25/E7/2E55A64B42B5EB2021229076E0B_4AD638AD_CA8E.png\"/></p>\n<p><span>2、营员需提前准备好个人展示PPT（如有），并于7月</span><span>19</span><span><span>